OL,3,GNEWSACadbury drama turns town into
OL,4,AVictorian Birmingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FChocolate giant Cadbury's origins are
OL,7,Fbeing brought to the screen in a new TV
OL,8,Fdrama that has turned part of a
OL,9,FMidlands town into Victorian
OL,10,FBirmingham.
OL,12,FThe Cadburys follows brothers Richard
OL,13,Fand George Cadbury as they try to
OL,14,Frescue their family's failing cocoa
OL,15,Fbusiness before creating one of the
OL,16,Fworld's best-known confectionery
OL,17,Fbrands.
OL,19,FThe six-part series stars Toby Regbo as
OL,20,FRichard, Harry Gilby as George and
OL,21,FJessica Barden as their sister Maria.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
