OL,3,GNEWSACadbury drama turns town into
OL,4,AVictorian Birmingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Street and St Martins Place in
OL,7,FStafford have been transformed for
OL,8,Ffilming, with production crews using
OL,9,Fthe town's historic streets to recreate
OL,10,Fscenes from 1860s Birmingham.
